 "_about": [
  "What both phones do alike without the engine, as one spec both run: the iPhone in ios/OrbitalUITests/SpecTests.swift, Android in android/shared/src/jvmTest SpecTest.kt.",
  "Each phone keeps its own copy of these rules (a tap must answer without a round trip through the page, and the widgets and the sample run without the engine); the copies are held to this file.",
  "ticks: a task's box ticked on the phone (ios/Common/Ticks.swift, Ticks.kt), times in seconds. activity: the Activity widget's lines (Glimpse.activity) and a status line drawn as its task (asTask). phrases: the app's words (ios/Common/Phrases.swift, Phrases.kt) and the kinds' glyphs (Glyph, Glyphs)."
 ],
